# Secure Login App

Full-stack authentication system with 2FA and role-based access.

## Stack
- **Frontend:** Next.js 16 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express, MySQL, mysql2
- **Auth:** JWT (httpOnly cookie), TOTP 2FA, Argon2id + salt + pepper

## Roles
- `inputer` — create data entries
- `manager` — add inputers
- `admin` — delete inputers, list users
- `administrator` — full control including role changes

## Quick start

### Backend
cd backend
npm install
cp .env.example .env   # fill in real values
# Run sql/schema.sql in MySQL Workbench first
npm run dev
# → http://localhost:4000

### Frontend
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
# → http://localhost:3000

## Security features
- Argon2id password hashing with per-user salt and global pepper
- TOTP two-factor authentication (Google Authenticator)
- JWT in httpOnly, SameSite=Lax cookies
- Rate limiting on auth endpoints
- Account lockout after 5 failed password attempts
- Audit log of all security-relevant events
- Parameterized SQL queries (no injection)
- Helmet + CORS restrictions

alice - StrongPass123!
bob - StrongPass456!